/-
# Reciprocal coordinates of the critical source field

Bundles the reciprocal side: cleared numerators of truncated reciprocal coefficients, nonvanishing on
every raw divisor `x_m = 0` with `m >= 2`, and affine-linear in the last raw coordinate; the
involution expressing raw coefficients through reciprocal ones; the first `m+n` reciprocal
coefficients as a second rational coordinate system on the source field; and the divisor `y_n = 0`,
which has order one on the marked reciprocal coordinate and order zero on the marked raw coordinate.
-/

